      "type": "title",
      "kicker": "PC Troubleshooting",
      "title": "Windows 11 Battery Drains Fast? 7 Fixes to Try",
      "subtitle": "Is your Windows 11 battery draining fast? Try these 7 fixes, from lowering screen…",
      "image": {
        "src": "post-media/windows-11-battery-drains-fast/01-7-ways-to-fix-draining-laptop-windows.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024
      },
